# 01 Frontend Next.js Rule / 前端 Next.js 规则

## Purpose / 目的
- Define strict frontend layering and directory contract for future implementation.
- 为未来前端实现定义严格分层与目录契约。

## Inputs / 输入
- Page requirement / 页面需求
- API contract / API 合同
- UI style rule / UI 风格规则

## Steps / 步骤
1. Use planned frontend structure only:
   - `frontend/src/app` (routes) / 路由
   - `frontend/src/features` (feature modules) / 功能模块
   - `frontend/src/components` (shared UI) / 通用组件
   - `frontend/src/lib` (api client/utils) / 基础库
2. Enforce layering: `app -> features -> components/lib`; reverse imports are forbidden. / 强制分层：`app -> features -> components/lib`，禁止反向依赖。
3. Keep data fetching in feature/application layer, not shared presentational components. / 数据获取放在功能或应用层，展示组件禁止直接取数。
4. Every page must define loading/empty/error states and permission fallback. / 每个页面必须定义加载/空态/错误态及权限兜底。
5. Do not execute Next.js scaffold/init commands in current stage. / 当前阶段禁止执行 Next.js 初始化命令。

## Output / 产出
- Frontend implementation blueprint with enforceable layering.
- 可执行的前端分层蓝图。

## Checklist / 检查清单
- [ ] Folder structure contract is followed. / 目录契约已遵循。
- [ ] Layer dependency direction is valid. / 分层依赖方向正确。
- [ ] State handling is complete. / 状态处理完整。
- [ ] No Next.js initialization executed. / 未执行 Next.js 初始化。
